WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
The harvest is not bad

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,840
Got a blue static gold box

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,240
Can temporarily pause the target

4
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,040
Obtain time-related benefits for the first time

5
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:09,200
And stillness can be combined with the Ice Realm Gold Box to become a time-frozen purple gold box.

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,760
Stop time in a small area

7
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,920
However, life forms entering this area will also be affected

8
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,920
But it’s very useful for preserving supplies.

9
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,640
This way you don’t have to worry about some materials going bad.

10
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,240
what is going on

11
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,560
I only control the losses with gold boxes to queue up, but this loss

12
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,480
I didn't give it any orders at all.

13
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,440
It actually walked towards me and

14
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,240
I didn't feel the presence of a gold box inside its body, which is interesting.

15
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,340
See what it is

16
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:46,380
It's a little strange what it's doing
